    "title": "Madison Library Barn to be dedicated - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Madison County Journal\nwebsite\nMadison County, Mississippi\nMadison Library Barn to be dedicated\nBy Editorials,\n23 hours agoMADISON — A trio of “take a book, leave a book” Library Barns installed earlier this year will be dedicated. Leadership Madison County will hold a dedication for the Library Barn at Liberty Park at 4:30 p.m., Aug. 14, LMC member Rod Henderson said. The Library Barn is located between the new Splash Pad and the playground.",
